
// THE MAGMA FORM'S TAIL SWIPE - the two animations the last round could not tell apart.
// Converted from the OSRS cache by tools/models/animconvosrs.py; they play on their own base
// (base_osrs_5695), not the 377 one, so the client never walk-merges them with a 377 animation.
//
// WHICH OF 5806 AND 5807 IS THE STRIKE was settled by the converted frame lists below, not by
// rendering and squinting - the two are FRAME-FOR-FRAME IDENTICAL for their first 35 frames, which
// is the rear-up-and-stare the wiki describes ("Zulrah will stare at the player's position for
// several seconds before whipping its tail at that area"), and then they part:
//
//   5806  frames 36-39 replay 18-26 and then 18,19,20 AGAIN - a hold loop, and a hold loop is
//         what an animation that waits for something looks like. It is the TARGET animation.
//   5807  frames 36-46 break into frames 40-45, which appear nowhere else on the rig, and come
//         back through 25 - one new excursion and a recovery. It is the STRIKE.
//
// That reading agrees with the ids the private-server community publishes for this snake (melee
// target 5806, melee attack 5807, rune-server thread "Zulrah Animation/GFX Ids"), which is the
// only other source that names them at all.
//
// ONLY 5807 IS PLAYED. zulrah_combat.rs2 fires the swipe on the beat and lands it a beat later;
// because 5807 CONTAINS the stare - those identical first 35 frames, 4.67 ticks of them - the
// player sees the wind-up and the strike from one animation, which is what OSRS shows. 5806 is
// kept here named and packed because it is Zulrah's, it is the evidence for the paragraph above,
// and the next reader should not have to derive it twice.
//
// THE ANIMATION IS LONGER THAN THE BEAT and neither number was bent to make them agree: 5807 is
// 200 client cycles (6.67 ticks) at the cache's own delays, and the wiki's attack speed for all
// three forms is 3 ticks. A second swipe therefore cuts the first one short, exactly as a long
// attack animation does on every other npc in this build.

[zulrah_tail_target]
// OSRS seq 5806 - the stare. Not played; see the header.
reachforward=yes
priority=6
frame1=anim_osrs_5695_1
delay1=4
frame2=anim_osrs_5695_2
delay2=4
frame3=anim_osrs_5695_3
delay3=4
frame4=anim_osrs_5695_4
delay4=4
